gh their children in fact my  two friends  in hawaii who have passed at a very  young age  her son one son just got married and he  brought me back there as auntie or  second mom  and the other girlfriend who passed her  daughter is now in law school  and she came here two weeks ago and i  got to hug her  and you feel that you feel that you were  part of that life  and it goes on their life goes on  congratulations and thank you so much  sally for more information on southwest  medical hospice or to become a volunteer  yourself  call 702-671-1111 or visit the website  on your screen  remember there are virtual and in-person  opportunities as a hospice volunteer  las vegas now
 

